Below is the list of the top 100 scores on the storm.tamu.edu nethack server.
Also, today, our internet connection speed was increased 3-fold, and should
be a full t1 circuit by the summer.  (i.e. netlag should decrease dramatically)

to play on the storm.tamu.edu nethack server, telnet to storm.tamu.edu and
login as nethack.  there is no password.  The game is defaulted to NO options,
so you even have to turn numbpad on.  I am working on a new version of the
server that will enable you to set options before entering the game.  That
server should be up by the summer.  At that time, I will re-write to source
and post it for anonymous ftp.

